## 📂 Core Modules

### Authentication Module

#### Register Tenant
Creates:
- New tenant workspace
- Root administrator account

```http
POST /api/v1/auth/register
```

#### Login

```http
POST /api/v1/auth/login
```

Returns:
- Access Token
- Refresh Token

Authentication workflow requirements are defined in the blueprint.

---

### Content Type Module

Create dynamic schemas:

```http
POST /api/v1/content-types
```

Only ADMIN users can access this endpoint.

Example schema:

```json
{
  "name": "Products",
  "slug": "products",
  "schema": [
    {
      "field": "sku",
      "type": "string",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "field": "price",
      "type": "number",
      "required": true
    }
  ]
}
```

Schema builder example:

---

### Content Module

#### Create Content

```http
POST /api/v1/content/:contentTypeSlug
```

#### Retrieve Content

```http
GET /api/v1/content/:contentTypeSlug
```

Supports:

- Pagination
- Sorting
- Filtering

#### Delete Content

```http
DELETE /api/v1/content/:contentTypeSlug/:id
```

Uses soft deletion rather than permanent database removal.

Content API workflow:

---

## 🔒 Security

The system implements:

- JWT Authentication
- Refresh Tokens
- Password Hashing
- RBAC Authorization
- Tenant-bound Queries
- Route Guards
- Dynamic Schema Validation

All queries are scoped by tenant context to prevent unauthorized access across organizations.

